    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>The Display block shows the instantaneous value of the bound signal as text, using the selected numeric format. It updates after every simulation step.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no input ports.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Output(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no output ports.</p>
