    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT resets the widget to its initial reading.</li>
      <li>AFTER_STEP samples the bound signal and refreshes the display.</li>
      <li>The block visualizes the signal only; it declares no input or output signal ports.</li>
    </ul>
